OL,3,ATwo teenagers, 13 and 14, among 33 UK
OL,4,Anationals missing in Nepal floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirty-three people from the UK,
OL,7,Fincluding a 13-year-old girl and
OL,8,F14-year-old boy, are among hundreds
OL,9,Fmissing following a deadly flash flood
OL,10,Fnear the Nepal-Tibet border.
OL,12,FNepali police said the death toll had
OL,13,Frisen to 359, while Nepal's National
OL,14,FDisaster Risk Reduction and Management
OL,15,FAuthority said more than 1,300 people
OL,16,Fare missing, with the Nepal Tourism
OL,17,FBoard saying 644 tourists are out of
OL,18,Fcontact.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
