OL,3,ANorway's royal family gathers at King
OL,4,AHarald's bedside as his condition
OL,5,Aworsens
OL,6,
OL,7,FKing Harald V of Norway is in an
OL,8,F"extremely serious" condition in
OL,9,Fhospital, the country's royal household
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FHis wife, Queen Sonja, and his son,
OL,13,FCrown Prince Haakon, have cancelled all
OL,14,Froyal engagements and they have
OL,15,Fgathered at his bedside at Oslo
OL,16,FUniversity Hospital with other members
OL,17,Fof the royal family.
OL,19,FThe 89-year-old has been in hospital
OL,20,Ffor over a week receiving treatment for
OL,21,Fa rare blood condition, haemolytic
OL,22,Fanaemia.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
